    <statement><p>Consider the sum <m>3 + 12 + 21 + 30 + \cdots + 291\text{.}</m></p>
<p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p>How many terms (summands) are in the sum?</p>
<p><fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Compute the sum using a technique discussed in this section.</p>
<p><fillin characters="2" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>33</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4851</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p>33.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>\frac{294 \cdot 32}{2} = 4851\text{.}</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</solution>
